{
  "slug": "dope-rug-2024-11",
  "kind": "token-rug",
  "title": "D.O.P.E (DOPE) liquidity pull, 14 November 2024",
  "network": "mainnet",
  "summary": "Chain-only case: no public source names it. At 23:17:00 UTC on 13 November 2024 hub wallet 0xf8856c07 sent 2,680 SUI to fresh wallet 0xca9aa6a2, which published DOPE (1B supply, TreasuryCap to 0x0) three seconds later, opened a full-range Cetus position with 2,546.03 SUI and 680M DOPE four seconds after that, and at 23:17:08 sent the remaining 288M DOPE (28.8%) back to the hub. At 23:18:08 the hub paid 56.8 SUI to each of 100 wallets, at least one of which it had also used to trade its earlier tokens (MAGOAT, APTRUMP). At 02:11:57 on 14 November the deployer removed all of the position's liquidity (4,287.10 SUI from the pool, 4,299.68 with fees) and 47 seconds later sent 4,433.45 SUI to the hub. The pool took in 1,753.6 SUI more than the deployer deposited; how much of that came from the hub's own wallets is unresolved. Over the next two days the hub funded at least seven more fresh wallets with 2,688 to 2,799 SUI each, and each put about 2,555 SUI into a new Cetus position.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "url": "https://suivision.xyz/txblock/G5dWmR2ncp36Vhczz8XurjVc3SY5qtpDNnDX95Xq2eqZ",
      "publisher": "chain",
      "kind": "official"
    }
  ],
  "subjects": {
