      "tier": "chain-derived",
      "basis": "Chain: all of DOPE's liquidity was one Cetus position the deployer held in its own wallet for its whole life.",
      "known_defect": "analyze_token names no pool, no liquidity and no LP holder, so the unlocked position in the deployer's wallet is invisible."
